{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"L'Amitié","« J’ai intensément partagé le travail cinématographique avec certains, jusqu’à une amitié toujours vive. Filmer aujourd’hui ce lien sentimental est un plaisir sans nostalgie. Nos vies croisées nous permettent cette simplicité rapide de ceux qui ne se racontent pas d’histoires, qui savent être devant ou derrière la caméra, dans un ensemble de dons et d’abandon au film. » Alain Cavalier",[4,5,6],"intragenerational friendship","independent home","intergenerational friendship",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":27,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":42,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_099","fr2023-099-l-amitie",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2023-04-26",2023,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Alain Cavalier","alain-cavalier",1931,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[28],"Documentary – Performative mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/225/5/263649/format_page/l-amitie.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NatWR-9iqBk",{"native":2,"english":12},[34],{"country":25,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
